{"id":119967,"vol":{"id":20095,"name":"Tales of the Sinestro Corps: Ion"},"num":"1","name":"The Ultimate Lantern","title":"Tales of the Sinestro Corps: Ion #1","year":"2008","date":"2008-01-01","store":"2007-12-12","poster":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_medium/0/40/255167-20095-119967-1-tales-of-the-sinestr.jpg","big":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_large/0/40/255167-20095-119967-1-tales-of-the-sinestr.jpg","pub":"DC Comics","deck":"","desc":"Overview\n\nIon is the chosen one of the Green Lantern Corps, whose coming was foretold as a prophecy in the Book of Oa. But now that Kyle Rayner has been possessed by Parallax, can he ever bear the mantle of Ion again? Or will it pass to a completely new bearer? This all-important Sinestro Corps War tie-in reveals the answers, and sets the stage for Green Lantern \u2014 and Kyle Rayner \u2014 for years to come!","people":[{"id":42763,"name":"Adam Schlagman","role":"editor"},{"id":2401,"name":"Ed Benes","role":"artist, cover"},{"id":41680,"name":"Eddie Berganza","role":"editor"},{"id":40439,"name":"Geoff Johns","role":"other"},{"id":3572,"name":"Jeromy Cox","role":"colorist"},{"id":42063,"name":"John J. Hill","role":"letterer"},{"id":44859,"name":"Michel Lacombe","role":"artist"},{"id":17708,"name":"Moose Baumann","role":"colorist, cover"},{"id":41799,"name":"Ron Marz","role":"writer"}],"chars":[{"id":11202,"name":"Hal Jordan","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/12/124259/9439462-green-lantern-16-main-cover-675x1024.jpg"},{"id":10451,"name":"John Stewart","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/1/15776/9988394-john_stewart.jpg"},{"id":40431,"name":"Kyle Rayner","image":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_small/1/15776/9988407-kyle_rayner.jpg"}],"arcs":[{"id":50650,"name":"\"Green Lantern\" Sinestro Corps War"}]}